      "title": "QA reports — derived results on a branch, judgements on `main`",
      "description": "Where a QA result lives now. Derived verdicts go to the orphan `qa-reports` branch, keyed by commit, written by the CI job `qa-publish`. Judgements stay on main in the `attestations` graph. Gates compute and judge against a stored baseline, and a missing one is unknown. Read before you regenerate, commit, resolve, cite or delete anything under `test/results/` or `test/attestations/`.",
